<title>USA: CATTLE-FAX AVERAGE FEEDLOT CATTLE PRICES - AUG 8.</title>
<headline>CATTLE-FAX AVERAGE FEEDLOT CATTLE PRICES - AUG 8.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average prices for feedlot steers in the main U.S. six-state and three-state regions, according to CATTLE-FAX (in dollars per cwt) --</p>
<p>6 STATES -  Thursday	  Aug   7  $65.18    dn 0.14</p>
<p> Wednesday	 Aug   6  $65.32    dn 0.54</p>
<p> Tuesday	   Aug   5  $65.86    dn 0.42</p>
<p>3 STATES -  Thursday	  Aug   7  $64.83    dn 0.19</p>
<p> Wednesday	 Aug   6  $65.02    dn 0.51</p>
<p> Tuesday	   Aug   5  $65.53    dn 0.49</p>
<p>Note: 6 states include TX, NE, KS, CO, OK, IA.</p>
<p>	    3 states include TX, KS, OK.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
</text>
